This repository contains the scripts, command lines, and example workflows used to reproduce the analyses presented in the manuscript:

**Plant-microbiome-genome coupling promotes incipient ecological speciation**

## Repository contents

- Population genomic analyses
- Structural variation analyses
- Microbiome analyses
- Transcriptome analyses
- Figure generation scripts

## Repository structure

demo_data/     Example datasets for testing the scripts
scripts/       Analysis and figure-generation scripts

## Software

The analyses were performed using commonly used bioinformatics software together with custom R and Python scripts. Software versions and key parameters are described in the manuscript and, where appropriate, within individual scripts.

## Availability

To ensure consistency between the peer-reviewed and published versions of the manuscript, this repository will remain private during the review process.

All scripts, example data, and analysis workflows will be made publicly available upon publication.

This repository is intended to accompany the manuscript and is not designed as a standalone software package.

Thank you for your interest in this work.
